{"ref":"BDB, פְּעֻלָּה","hw":"פְּעֻלָּה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">פְּעֻלָּה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. work, recompence</strong> (poet. and late);—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּעֻלַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.13\">Lv 19:13</a> +, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּעֻלָּתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.4\">Is 49:4</a>, etc.; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּעֻלּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:4\" href=\"/Psalms.17.4\">ψ 17:4</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">לֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 28:5\" href=\"/Psalms.28.5\">28:5</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>work:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  pl. <em>deeds of</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 28:5\" href=\"/Psalms.28.5\">ψ 28:5</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  of men, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:4\" href=\"/Psalms.17.4\">ψ 17:4</a> (pl.); toil, suffering <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.16\">Je 31:16</a>; good action <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.7\">2 Ch 15:7</a>, wicked <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.7\">Is 65:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ שָׁ֑קֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.18\">Pr 11:18</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>wages</em> (as earned by work) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.13\">Lv 19:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.16\">Pr 10:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּאָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.20\">Ez 29:20</a>; <em>reward</em> (from <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.4\">Is 49:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.8\">61:8</a>; prob. fig. of people won back by <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> in warfare <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.10\">40:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 62:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.62.11\">62:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂכָר</span>); of punishment, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:20\" href=\"/Psalms.109.20\">ψ 109:20</a>.","next":"BDB, פְּעֻלְּתַי","prev":"BDB, פֹּ֫עַל"}